[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12121.15, "timestamp": "03:22:01", "text": "啊，是那個。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12123.55, "timestamp": "03:22:03", "text": "看來我們別無選擇，只能再轉一圈了。嘿，我們。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12129.15, "timestamp": "03:22:09", "text": "鸕鶿，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12145.79, "timestamp": "03:22:25", "text": "哦，有人在那裡放了東西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12148.07, "timestamp": "03:22:28", "text": "我忘了帶。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12149.99, "timestamp": "03:22:29", "text": "哦，太好了，你有錘子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12167.63, "timestamp": "03:22:47", "text": "200米"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12176.99, "timestamp": "03:22:56", "text": "時間上也是如此。我這就用鐵鎚輕輕敲一下。"}]